      "content": "the problem is that the delegates aren't just annoyed, they're actually feeling like the delay in your feedback is causing them to miss subtle shifts in the room. if they're missing tone or micro-expressions because the system is lagging while you're crunching data, it's becoming a liability for the mission. so yeah, the live feed access is definitely getting cut to ensure they can keep up with the speed of the room.",
